This mod reimplements ideas from Bedrock Loader (FabricRock) by EaseCation, MIT licensed:
https://github.com/EaseCation/FabricRock

The structural approach it contributes is contributing a converted pack to the game through a
RepositorySource added at PackRepository construction, and registering Bedrock block, item and
entity definitions as data-driven Java registry entries. No FabricRock source is included; its
copyright notice is reproduced below as its licence requires of derived ideas carried across.

